			"Message": "chore(Project): Synchronize build tooling and style improvements across Land submodules\n\nAdvance the Element submodule with coordinated updates across eight Land components:\n\n- Common: Add TypeScript declaration files for Workers Cloudflare API (Access, Decrypt, Encrypt, Get, Put, Redirect, Response interfaces)\n- Output: Add ESBuild configuration enabling dual-compiler build system alongside Rest for Cocoon extension host\n- Rest: Reorder imports logically and standardize quote style to single quotes\n- Sky: Normalize Astro build artifact formatting with consistent quotes and trailing newlines\n- Wind: Reformat ESBuild configuration from minified to readable format and remove obsolete .d.ts files\n- Worker: Simplify ESBuild target configuration structure with direct variable assignment\n- Mountain: Fix dialog options DTO structure and path formatting for OpenDialog/SaveDialog handlers\n- Grove: Fix import path to use PascalCase module name per CLAUDE.md conventions\n\nThis coordinated update standardizes build tooling across the Land ecosystem while fixing API mismatches in the dialog integration.",
